 CellID->488247794,ExpressionUUID->"1a77059f-11ab-4f27-89e5-886f18df098e"],

Cell["\<\
A tensor passed to YoungSymmetrize or YoungProject must have ArrayDepth equal \
to TableauSize of the tableau:\
